  FLOOD
  FLASH_FLOOD
  CYCLONE
  STORM_SURGE
  HEATWAVE
  AIR_QUALITY
  WATER_POLLUTION
  LANDSLIDE
  DROUGHT
  WILDFIRE
  OTHER
